<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>글로벌 케미컬 트레이딩</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #0b3c5d;
      --secondary: #1f6f8b;
      --bg: #f5f7fa;
      --text: #222;
      --muted: #666;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Noto Sans KR", Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--bg);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    header {
      background: #fff;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
    }
    .nav {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 16px 24px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .logo {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 20px;
      color: var(--primary);
    }
    nav a {
      margin-left: 24px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    nav a:hover { color: var(--secondary); }

    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(120deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
      color: #fff;
      padding: 100px 24px;
    }
    .hero-inner {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 44px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .hero p {
      max-width: 720px;
      font-size: 18px;
      opacity: 0.95;
    }

    section {
      padding: 80px 24px;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: var(--primary);
    }
    .section-desc {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 700px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .card {
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    }
    .card h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      color: var(--primary);
    }
    .card p { color: var(--muted); }

    .products li {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
    }

    .contact {
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 40px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
      max-width: 600px;
    }
    input, textarea {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid #d1d5db;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    button {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      padding: 14px 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    button:hover { background: var(--secondary); }

    footer {
      background: #0b3c5d;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 40px 24px;
    }
    footer .container { font-size: 14px; color: #e5e7eb; }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .hero h1 { font-size: 32px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="nav">
    <div class="logo">Global Chemical Trading</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#about">회사소개</a>
      <a href="#services">서비스</a>
      <a href="#products">제품</a>
      <a href="#contact">문의</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <h1>글로벌 산업용 화학제품 공급 파트너</h1>
    <p>
      당사는 전 세계 신뢰할 수 있는 제조사와 협력하여
      고품질 산업용 및 특수 화학제품을 안정적으로 공급하는
      B2B 화학 트레이딩 기업입니다.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">회사 소개</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">
      Global Chemical Trading은 화학 원료 유통 분야에서 축적된 경험과
      글로벌 네트워크를 기반으로 고객 맞춤형 공급 솔루션을 제공합니다.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="services">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">주요 서비스</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>글로벌 소싱</h3>
        <p>검증된 해외 제조사로부터 안정적인 화학 원료 공급</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>품질 관리</h3>
        <p>국제 기준에 부합하는 품질 및 규격 관리</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>물류 & 배송</h3>
        <p>고객 일정에 맞춘 유연한 물류 솔루션 제공</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>맞춤 대응</h3>
        <p>산업별·용도별 맞춤 제품 제안</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="products">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">제품 카테고리</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card products">
        <h3>Alcohols & Solvents</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Ethanol</li>
          <li>Methanol</li>
          <li>Isopropyl Alcohol</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card products">
        <h3>Organic Chemicals</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#ethyl-acetate"><strong>Ethyl Acetate (ETAC)</strong></a></li>
          <li>Acetic Acid</li>
          <li>Glycols</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card products">
        <h3>Inorganic Chemicals</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Sodium Hydroxide</li>
          <li>Calcium Carbonate</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="ethyl-acetate">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Ethyl Acetate (ETAC)</h2>
    <p class="section-desc">
      Ethyl Acetate는 다양한 산업 분야에서 사용되는 대표적인 유기 용제로,
      높은 순도와 안정적인 품질로 글로벌 시장에서 널리 활용되고 있습니다.
    </p>

    <div class="grid">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>기본 정보</h3>
        <p>
          <strong>Chemical Formula:</strong> C4H8O2<br>
          <strong>CAS No.:</strong> 141-78-6<br>
          <strong>HS Code:</strong> 29153100
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>주요 용도</h3>
        <p>
          Paints & Coatings<br>
          Adhesives<br>
          Printing Inks<br>
          Pharmaceuticals & Cosmetics
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>포장 및 공급</h3>
        <p>
          Drum Packing<br>
          IBC Tank<br>
          ISO Tank<br>
          (Bulk available upon request)
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>공급 특징</h3>
        <p>
          Stable global sourcing<br>
          Consistent quality control<br>
          Flexible logistics solutions
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">문의하기</h2>
    <div class="contact">
      <input type="text" placeholder="회사명" />
      <input type="email" placeholder="이메일" />
      <textarea rows="5" placeholder="문의 내용을 입력해 주세요"></textarea>
      <button>문의 보내기</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="container">
    <p>© 2026 Global Chemical Trading Co.</p>
    <p>Email: info@globalchemicaltrading.com</p>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
